          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion or transmutation in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>",
